{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/TitleV2.png?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh hi !<br>You're the new intern right ?... Good good.<br>There are two rules in this company : Do your job and stay at your place.<br>Remember this, and it will all go down nicely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now here is your gun and your contract. The elevator is just down the corridor. You got work to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You got back ! Not yet burned out hey ?... Oh, it will come soon, enough.   <br>Good thing you brought back some resources ! This office could really use an upgrade or two.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're going back in ? If you find colleagues down there, tell them I said hi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey, what you got here ?! I'm not sure this is allowed... You should put it back where you found it and pretend it does not exist.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Damn, where are we ?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/Gif5.gif?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I've got a message from upstairs. It says &quot;You should wishlist the game.&quot; Whatever that means...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2684550?t=1750879290","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2684550?t=1750879290","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/3f7bc56dd97e278b80c4270c232b0c7c470d556e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750879290","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/3f7bc56dd97e278b80c4270c232b0c7c470d556e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750879290","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/TitleV2.png?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh hi !<br>You're the new intern right ?... Good good.<br>There are two rules in this company : Do your job and stay at your place.<br>Remember this, and it will all go down nicely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now here is your gun and your contract. The elevator is just down the corridor. You got work to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You got back ! Not yet burned out hey ?... Oh, it will come soon, enough.   <br>Good thing you brought back some resources ! This office could really use an upgrade or two.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're going back in ? If you find colleagues down there, tell them I said hi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey, what you got here ?! I'm not sure this is allowed... You should put it back where you found it and pretend it does not exist.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Damn, where are we ?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/Gif5.gif?t=1750879290\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I've got a message from upstairs. It says &quot;You should wishlist the game.&quot; Whatever that means...</p>","developers":["Maxence Jacquot"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/30b821bfaf08f078370fb9fd235e93f00b447a26/header.jpg?t=1750879290","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257148700,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148700/movie480.mp4?t=1748654253","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148700/movie_max.mp4?t=1748654253"},"name":"Work In Progress - Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148700/24361520f2c9e558052b4c7cf7d07f7d35308da9/movie_600x337.j